    "learnings": "Respond to a public foresight warning before approaching nearby loot when a charged Talisman can inspect it. Preserve unidentified supplies without assuming their effects. A vanished potion is not a pickup receipt, and choosing reconnaissance does not prove a blocked puzzle is solved."
